TIMING-6#1 Critical Warning
No common primary clock between related clocks  
The clocks clk500 and clk125 are related (timed together) but they have no common primary clock. The design could fail in hardware. To find a timing path between these clocks, run the following command: report_timing -from [get_clocks clk500] -to [get_clocks clk125]
Related violations: <none>

TIMING-7#1 Critical Warning
No common node between related clocks  
The clocks clk500 and clk125 are related (timed together) but they have no common node. The design could fail in hardware. To find a timing path between these clocks, run the following command: report_timing -from [get_clocks clk500] -to [get_clocks clk125]
Related violations: <none>

